=== seq-ai
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web / Gateway
  participant M as MealPlanning
  participant Q as RabbitMQ
  participant R as Recommendation
  participant D as DietKnowledge
  participant G as Gemini
  U->>W: Request meal ideas (tags, days 1-14)
  W->>M: POST /api/meal-recommendations
  M->>M: Save request + OutboxMessage (1 transaction)
  M-->>U: Pending (answered at once)
  M-)Q: Outbox dispatcher publishes recommendation.requests
  Q-)R: Consume
  R->>D: GET approved knowledge / semantic search
  R->>G: generateContent (or safe local fallback)
  R-)Q: Publish recommendation.results
  Q-)M: Consume, status = Completed
  U->>M: Accept (edit) recommendation
  M->>M: Create MealPlan + items, status = Accepted
=== seq-reminder
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant M as MealPlanning
  participant Q as RabbitMQ
  participant N as NotificationWorker
  participant B as Brevo
  U->>M: Add meal item (date, slot)
  M->>M: Validate rules, save item + Outbox reminder
  M-)Q: reminder.requests
  Q-)N: Consume
  N->>B: Confirmation email at once
  N->>N: Hold in TTL delay queue until ReminderAtUtc
  N->>M: GET /internal/reminders/{id} (X-Internal-Key)
  alt item still exists with same time
    N->>B: Send reminder email
  else deleted or rescheduled
    N->>N: Drop stale reminder
  end
=== seq-progress
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant T as Tracking
  participant N as Notification (gRPC)
  participant Q as RabbitMQ
  participant W as NotificationWorker
  participant B as Brevo
  U->>T: PUT /api/daily-trackings/{date}/meals/{id}
  T->>T: Update MealTracking, recalc ProgressSummary
  alt all planned meals of the day completed (first time)
    T->>N: gRPC RequestProgressNotification
    N-)Q: Publish notification.messages
    Q-)W: Consume
    W->>B: Send email
  end
=== seq-book
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Admin
  participant D as DietKnowledge
  participant G as Gemini
  participant V as VectorDb
  A->>D: Upload PDF/TXT (max 25 MB)
  D->>D: Extract text, split into chunks
  A->>D: Generate candidates (batch)
  D->>G: Summarize chunk (or placeholder)
  D->>D: Save KnowledgeCandidate = NeedsReview
  A->>D: Approve / reject candidate
  D->>D: Approve creates Approved guideline / food / recipe
  D->>V: Index approved content (embeddings)
=== seq-auth
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web
  participant G as API Gateway
  participant I as Identity
  participant S as Any service
  U->>W: Email + password
  W->>G: POST /identity/api/auth/login
  G->>I: forward
  I-->>W: JWT (id, email, role)
  W->>W: Store JWT in HttpOnly cookie
  U->>W: Open page
  W->>G: Request + Bearer JWT
  G->>S: forward (prefix removed)
  S->>S: Validate signature with shared key, check role
  S-->>W: Data of this user only
=== state-candidate
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> NeedsReview: candidate generated
  NeedsReview --> Approved: Admin approves
  NeedsReview --> Rejected: Admin rejects
  Approved --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]
=== state-doc
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Uploaded
  Uploaded --> Chunked: text extracted
  Uploaded --> Failed: no readable text
  Chunked --> Chunked: generate candidates in batches
=== state-reco
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Pending: user requests
  Pending --> Completed: result consumed
  Completed --> Accepted: user accepts
  Accepted --> [*]
=== state-tracking
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Active: start
  Active --> Completed: finish
  Active --> Cancelled: cancel
  Completed --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
=== deploy
flowchart TB
  Browser[Browser] -->|:5000| web
  subgraph Docker[Docker Compose network]
    web[web MVC] --> gw[api-gateway YARP :5001]
    gw --> id[identity :5101]
    gw --> dk[diet-knowledge :5102]
    gw --> mp[meal-planning :5103]
    gw --> tr[tracking :5104]
    id --> idb[(identity-db :5433)]
    dk --> dkdb[(diet-knowledge-db :5434)]
    dk --> vdb[(vector-db pgvector :5437)]
    mp --> mpdb[(meal-planning-db :5435)]
    tr --> trdb[(tracking-db :5436)]
    tr -->|gRPC| ns[notification-service :5105]
    ns --> mq{{RabbitMQ :5672 / :15672}}
    mp --> mq
    mq --> rec[recommendation-service]
    rec --> mq
    mq --> wk[notification-worker]
    rec --> dk
    mp --> dk
    wk --> mp
  end
  rec -->|HTTPS| gem[Google Gemini]
  dk -->|HTTPS| gem
  wk -->|HTTPS| brevo[Brevo]
